WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.085 --> 00:00:03.465
My name is Starr. Two Rs.

00:00:03.765 --> 00:00:04.895
Daddy named me that.

00:00:05.635 --> 00:00:08.645
Garden Heights. Mom and Daddy say our life is here

00:00:08.645 --> 00:00:10.435
cause our people are here.

00:00:11.265 --> 00:00:14.215
The high school is where you go to get drunk, high

00:00:14.215 --> 00:00:16.435
or pregnant. We don't go there.

00:00:17.495 --> 00:00:20.355
Williamson is another world, so when I'm here

00:00:20.355 --> 00:00:21.355
I'm Starr version 2.

00:00:21.740 --> 00:00:24.805
Until the weekend comes around.

00:00:24.805 --> 00:00:25.800
 

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:27.700
What's up? Where you've been?

00:00:27.955 --> 00:00:30.500
- Man, I know you been hanging with all the white kids. - Shut up!

00:00:31.115 --> 00:00:32.995
 

00:00:35.425 --> 00:00:37.015
Out. Of. The car.

00:00:37.655 --> 00:00:40.555
- Yo, Starr, you okay? - Go back where he told you. Khalil, I'm not playing, go back where...

00:00:40.555 --> 00:00:41.555
 

00:00:46.655 --> 00:00:49.665
Today Garden Heights is reeling after the shooting of a

00:00:49.665 --> 00:00:52.915
seventeen-year-old black teenager by a white police officer.

00:00:55.185 --> 00:00:56.185
Violence.

00:00:56.495 --> 00:00:57.900
Brutality.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:00:59.545
We live in a complicated world.

00:00:59.545 --> 00:01:01.665
It doesn't seem that complicated to me.

00:01:04.995 --> 00:01:06.765
It's about more than just Khalil.

00:01:07.845 --> 00:01:10.235
It's about black people, poor people, everybody at the bottom.

00:01:11.025 --> 00:01:12.845
I need to speak for him.

00:01:19.665 --> 00:01:21.165
When you ready to talk, you talk.

00:01:22.185 --> 00:01:24.185
I never let nobody make you be quiet.

00:01:25.565 --> 00:01:27.275
I ain't named you Starr by accident.

00:01:38.115 --> 00:01:39.115
 

